674821615229_9044775275073634304_n.png?_nc_cat=110&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=cEU74_thqzUQ7kNvwG01qA1&_nc_oc=Ado9FI_6xgvIWa8fNdCVzpLCXvyDluu3_s0UjYNepqLoeH7X0qh51HhBQ7xwh4uFKeY&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af9bG6LcM46DJr6mcW21VfOH04w8WxVHBZyUiWblBRtrtw&oe=6A340159"}, {"file_name": "migrated_image.png", "id": "2513502842299488", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/11162726_1854054711577045_5582650056718155776_n.png?_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Oy3gudyltIsQ7kNvwG_F2lV&_nc_oc=AdpeFfqkCvaqWg3N4p16TyLOi66o7amc9MzmyPEj4w6MRy8k1fJqY4A_4kcyZT6XmL4&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af_5HBi64mpVbKXObLzW3H9DQZk2fAMz-BqPkvwl9k9Dzg&oe=6A340A16"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "Icon.png", "id": "1720845498222971", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/11162687_1720845501556304_758256641949827072_n.png?_nc_cat=100&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=99JeE3kpAIEQ7kNvwGdJSnL&_nc_oc=AdpPV18x662gHYOsIQU40m09c8Yev3NDtnj-NWHQeGO_cQGbr5FcmzLFpbli9J4kvyU&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af-5WWI10ylqJqC0EZgJno3pKTm7q4q6IOf58Hj7SDZE4A&oe=6A340631"}, "display_name": "Evil Presence", "keywords": ["horror", "hospital", "scary", "jumpscare", "haunted"], "long_description": "Venture into the unknown, but beware of what lurks behind these walls. Evil Presence is a physiological horror experience like no other, built exclusively for virtual reality. The hospital once belonged to a very wealthy family but now it has been abandoned. Your goal is to collect bags of money lying, however the hospital is now home to a monstrous abomination, an experiment gone wrong.\n\nEvery play-through will be different as the hospital features some random generation. \n\nCan you make it out alive?\n\nHeadphones and a Gear VR controller are recommended but not required.\n\nWARNING: CONTAINS PLENTY OF JUMP SCARES", "short_descrip